      "q": "How much does Motorola Solutions make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "Motorola Solutions has $302M in federal contract obligations for FY2026 to date. Motorola Solutions won 188 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $1.6M, and obligations are up 58.6% year over year."
