    {
      "q": "Which agencies buy from Motorola Solutions?",
      "a": "The Department of Justice, the Department of Homeland Security, and the Department of Defense are Motorola Solutions' top buyers. The Department of Justice obligated $155M, the Department of Homeland Security obligated $74.1M, and the Department of Defense obligated $65.2M in FY2026 to date; smaller obligations came from the Departments of Veterans Affairs, the Treasury, the Interior, State, Health and Human Services, Education, and the GSA."
    },
    {
      "q": "What does Motorola Solutions sell to the government?",
